3672/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして人間性を試すドッキリを私達仕掛けられました(。>д<)(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずスタッフさんから電話きて、\n『◯号室に来てください』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言われたから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『今かずみん お風呂入ってるから、かずみんが出たら一緒にいきます』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言って、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはもうお風呂も入ってたしベッドにゴロゴロしてて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんがお風呂から出た時に電話があったから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行こう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".................."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってかずみんが思った時には\nまあやは眠さに勝てず寝てしまってました...(T-T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかげでメンバーとバナナマンさんをお待たせしちゃうことになっちゃうし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝起きでしかもスッピンでTVに出ちゃうし......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マカオでまあやは沢山の初体験しましたよ......笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/14/7953672/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マカオにてOFFショット"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/14/7953672/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんにダッコしてもらってるのっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/14/7953672/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"t