re/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/14/7953672/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/14/7953672/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/14/7953672/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/14/7953672/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/14/7953672/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/14/7953672/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/14/7953672/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆、学校行って偉いねっていって誉めてくれる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/14/7953672/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは沢山の優しいお姉ちゃんが居てくれて幸せだぁ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/14/7953672/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眠くても頑張ろう！って思う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/14/7953672/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなってしまったけど矢田里沙子ちゃん♪\nおめでとうございます〜(^o^)\n素敵な１年になりますように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントで3月生まれたの方も教えてくれてたね♪(#^.^#)\nいつも応援ありがとうございます！\n素敵な１年になりますように！\n願ってますo(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早起きの仕方、沢山のコメントありがとうございました！\nまあやもやってる〜！ってのもあったし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へ〜ってのが沢山あったから色々試してみようと思いますo(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに昨日は早く寝てみたよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも...眠たかった...笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大震災のブログにも沢山の方がコメントをくださって、ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでて胸があつくなりました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやのブログに涙してくれる方や"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう って言ってくださる方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知らない事を教えてくださる方\n本当にありがとうございますm(__)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の言葉にまあやの方が又勇気をもらいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆の地元の美味しい食べ物ってある？\n最近まあやは牡蠣が食べたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島の牡蠣は凄くプリプリして美味しいんだよ〜(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"牡蠣が入ったお好み焼きも美味しいよ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京にもあるのかな〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も皆が笑顔でありますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/14/7953672/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛媛で地震がありましたが大丈夫ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"}],"source":"archive"}